 "remarks": "Welcome to this beautifully renovated 4-bedroom, 2.5-bathroom home, situated in the desirable Belltown neighborhood of Stamford, CT. Thoughtfully updated from top to bottom, this move-in-ready residence offers the perfect blend of modern comfort and timeless style. Step inside to discover an inviting open-concept layout, featuring a living area filled with natural light and elegant finishes throughout. The stunning, fully updated kitchen boasts sleek cabinetry, quartz countertops, and stainless steel appliances.  Upstairs, you'll find 3 bedrooms including a spacious primary suite with custom walk-in closet. The 3rd floor boasts a flex space perfect for an additional bedroom or playroom. Both the full & half bathrooms have been tastefully renovated with contemporary fixtures and finishes. Outside, enjoy a covered patio and yard ideal for relaxing, and entertaining.  With its central location, this home offers easy access to shopping, dining, parks, and major commuting routes, making it perfect for today's lifestyle. Don't miss this opportunity to own a turnkey home in one of Stamford's most sought-after neighborhoods.",
